<!--
    Salesforce Platform App Builder (CRT-403) learning lab — FULL manifest.

    Declarative-first by design. The Apex classes and the single trigger listed
    under "code" exist only because the exam asks you to recognise when code is
    the right (and wrong) answer; every equivalent requirement elsewhere in the
    project is met with configuration.

    Split manifests:
      package-declarative.xml  — configuration only, no Apex (the declarative baseline)
      package-code.xml         — only the Apex that the guides deliberately teach
      package-org-settings.xml — org-level settings touched in the App Builder guide
-->
